    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: In oncogene-positive embryos, compare tumour incidence and reversal after voltage-state manipulation with oncogene-only, channel-only and nonconducting-channel controls while verifying persistent oncogene expression. Prevention or normalization despite unchanged oncogene supports the claim.";
