    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "Developmental Xenopus tumours may not generalize to mammalian cancer.", "Normalization needs histological and long-term endpoints.", "Raw randomized animal-level results may not be open.";
